	(text "Firmware: CLK_EN high only after the FPGA rails are up; allow the 3 ms startup time (ASEMB p.1).\nY4 runs from FPGA_IO_VOLTAGE, which stays on with the MCU rails, so only CLK_EN stops the clock\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
